  "prefLabel": "Adm 215.02 Contents of Explanation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 215.02 Contents of Explanation. The commissioner shall, within 90 days of receiving a request in accordance with Adm 215.01, provide a written response which:\n\n(a) Concisely states the meaning of the rule adopted;\n\n(b) Concisely states the principal reasons for and against the adoption of the rule in its final form; and\n\n(c) States, if applicable, why the commissioner did not accept arguments and considerations presented against the rule.\n\nSource. #8909, eff 9-22-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/adm200.html"
